# Certification Decision Engine

Nieuwe kernfunctie:

```rust
pub fn certify(
    trias: ValidationResult,
    oracle: ValidationResult,
    mentor: ValidationResult,
) -> CertificationStatus {

    match (
        trias,
        oracle,
        mentor,
    ) {

        (
            ValidationResult::Passed,
            ValidationResult::Passed,
            ValidationResult::Passed,
        ) =>
            CertificationStatus::Approved,

        (
            ValidationResult::Failed(_),
            _,
            _
        )
        |
        (
            _,
            ValidationResult::Failed(_),
            _
        )
        |
            (
            _,
            _,
            ValidationResult::Failed(_)
        ) =>
            CertificationStatus::Rejected,

        _ =>
            CertificationStatus::Pending,
    }
}
```

