🔧 **PIS-026 — MASTER IMPLEMENTATION BLUEPRINT v1.0.0**
*Edition: PALACO Foundation Edition v1.0.0*
*Depends on: PAS-014 — Master Architecture Reference v1.0.0*
*Target: Concrete Rust Workspace, Crate Layout, Traits & Build Pipeline*
### 1. Purpose & Scope
PIS-026 operationalizes **PAS-014**. It moves PALACO from architectural doctrine into an enforceable, production-grade Rust workspace layout. This blueprint defines the exact Cargo workspace topology, inter-crate dependency enforcement, foundational traits, and the CI validation pipeline required to achieve **Core Alpha**.
### 2. Workspace Directory Structure
The PALACO codebase is structured as a strict Cargo workspace enforcing the dependency graph defined in PAS-014 (Foundation \rightarrow EventBus \rightarrow Harbor \rightarrow Quay \rightarrow Citadel \rightarrow Federation \rightarrow Intelligence \rightarrow Evolution).
```text
